Well, because of the bug, blessing your food is completely pointless;
the chance of it being rotten is going to be exactly the same.  The
intent of the code is to make it so that it takes longer before a blessed
food item has a chance of being rotten, but that doesn't work.

Incidentally, I said earlier that I thought that this bug would be most
noticable when eating corpses.  Turns out that I was wrong about that ...
corpses are handled in a different function, and for them it's just a flat
1/7 chance of being rotten, regardless of corpse age.

